      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "HydraFusion has an updated model pool, improved orchestration workflows, and introduces HydraFusion Max.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-14-hydrafusion-updates-and-new-max-option",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T20:01:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T09:31:20.050Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Both HydraFusion and HydraFusion Max are available across VS Code, the GitHub Copilot app, and GitHub Copilot CLI and remain in research preview.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-14-hydrafusion-updates-and-new-max-option",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T20:01:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T09:31:20.050Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "HydraFusion orchestrates multiple models to produce a single response, bringing together their strengths so you don&rsquo;t have to choose an individual model for each task.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-14-hydrafusion-updates-and-new-max-option",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T20:01:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T09:31:20.050Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Latest frontier models: HydraFusion and HydraFusion Max draw from a pool that now includes Claude Opus 5.5, GPT-6 Astra, GPT-6.1 Sol, and GPT-6 Luna.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-14-hydrafusion-updates-and-new-max-option",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T20:01:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T09:31:20.050Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Reasoning effort tailored to each step: Previously, HydraFusion only used each model&rsquo;s default reasoning effort.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-14-hydrafusion-updates-and-new-max-option",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T20:01:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T09:31:20.050Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "HydraFusion Max is built on the same architecture and uses the same workflow techniques as HydraFusion, but is tuned for frontier capability on more demanding tasks.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-14-hydrafusion-updates-and-new-max-option",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T20:01:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T09:31:20.050Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Both options are supported across all three clients, so you can access the latest HydraFusion experience whether you work in VS Code, the GitHub Copilot app, or the terminal.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-14-hydrafusion-updates-and-new-max-option",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T20:01:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T09:31:20.050Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "HydraFusion and HydraFusion Max are available on Copilot Pro, Pro+, Business, and Enterprise plans with experimental or preview features enabled, subject to your organization&rsquo;s model policies.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-14-hydrafusion-updates-and-new-max-option",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T20:01:35.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T09:31:20.050Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Learn more in the HydraFusion documentation .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-14-hydrafusion-updates-and-new-max-option",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T20:01:35.000Z",
